# Route: guide 34 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Troll (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 52 to 54, 42
# quests, 2.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Western Plaguelands, Tirisfal Glades): Felstone Field -> Sorrow Hill
# -> Ruins of Andorhal -> Sorrow Hill -> Northridge Lumber Camp -> Felstone
# Field -> Northridge Lumber Camp -> Hearthglen -> The Weeping Cave ->
# Northridge Lumber Camp -> Hearthglen -> Northridge Lumber Camp -> Thondroril
# River -> ….
#
